<p><%= t("expiry_email.intro", name: @name) %></p>

<P>Your full Spaciable access has now expired but that doesn’t mean you can’t still enjoy its benefits!<P>

<P>You will still be able to use your login details to access the portal and information about your home.  However, you will no longer receive notifications from your developer or be able to upload your own documents to the Library.  The branding will also revert to Spaciable.</P>

<p>If you want to continue to receive developer updates and be able to upload your own documents, which can be important for any future home sales, you can renew your access for just £<%=@payment_charge%> per year, using the link below:</p>

<a href="<%= @payment_link %>"><%= image_tag(@payment_logo, style: "display: block;width:200px;margin: 20px auto;") %></a>

<p>We hope you’ve enjoyed using Spaciable and continue to do so.</p>

<p>Kind regards,</p>

<p>The Spaciable Team</p>
